title: EMR Connect › Sync › What a sync pulls and when it runs
route: /emr
intro: What the agents bring in from a connected system, and when. The demo shows this with counters and one log line per sync. The schedule and the real pull come from the PRD.
dir: TD
also: In the demo only 'Sync now' runs a sync. Demo, Fast-forward changes the 'ago' times and never starts one. No new chart, case or file appears anywhere else in the app. A sync waits while Reader is paused, and asks first when Reader is set to 'Ask before acting'.
---
start s1 "A sync runs"

group gWhen "When it runs"
  click w1 "Person clicks 'Sync now'\nThe only trigger in the demo"
  wait w2 "Production: on a schedule, nobody clicks\nAttendance twice a day, roster nightly, payments weekly, eligibility on a rolling 7 days, portal status daily"
  toast w3 "Production: a missed run raises a stale banner\nAttendance after 36 hours, roster after 48 hours"
endgroup

ext x1 "The record system\nResidential site, outpatient site, Billing system or a newly connected one"

group gPull "What the agents read"
  doc d1 "Clinical record systems\nAssessments, progress notes, labs, medications, insurance card"
  doc d2 "Billing system\nClaims, remittances, payment dates"
  process d3 "New admissions\nA patient who has just arrived at a site"
endgroup

agent a1 "Reader\nReads each file, swaps names, dates and IDs for codes, matches the chart to an open case"
agent a2 "Verify\nRe-checks coverage for members whose plans changed"
process p1 "Fields it cannot place go to 'Needs a mapping'"
store s2 "Charts matched today\nGoes up by the number of charts matched to open cases"
store s3 "Files pulled this week\nGoes up by the number of files saved to those cases"
store s4 "Recent activity\nOne line per sync"
process p2 "Demo: nothing else changes\nNo new case in Case Manager. New case offers the same four charts, from Connected systems only"
process e1 "Last sync tile reads 'Just now'"
goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › Sync now"
goto g2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"
goto g3 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › What other screens use from EMR Connect"

s1 --> w1 & w2
w2 -.-> w3
w1 --> g1
w1 --> x1
w2 --> x1
x1 --> d1 & d2 & d3
d1 & d2 & d3 --> a1
a1 --> a2
a1 --> p1
p1 --> g2
a1 --> s2 & s3
a2 --> s4
s2 & s3 & s4 --> e1
e1 --> p2
p2 --> g3
